<attribute name="problem" nodeId="e011e5a7">&lt;p&gt;
    EY&apos;s Smart Delivery tool that provides a standard and more informed way of estimating Oracle Services implementation
    deals and engagements. ​
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The tool helps estimate an engagement, a portion of a project or a change request.​ It provides the ability to make
    decisions on trade-offs regarding scope, time and cost and can be tailored to individual sub-domains or technologies.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="background" nodeId="f84a0edc">&lt;p&gt;
